{"id":"wb-6-121","name":"偪阳故城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"偪阳故城","text":"偪阳故城位于山东省枣庄市台儿庄区侯塘村，是周代诸侯国偪阳国封地遗址。城址南北向，呈长方形，现存城墙周长约3386米，勘探发现6座城门，其中南、北墙各1座，东、西墙各2座。1992年考古发掘，后多次勘探。2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%81%AA%E9%98%B3%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":86856708,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856708","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9e871588a7561e2210f62751.jpg","title":"台儿庄偪阳故城.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%B0%E5%84%BF%E5%BA%84%E5%81%AA%E9%98%B3%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/%E5%8F%B0%E5%84%BF%E5%BA%84%E5%81%AA%E9%98%B3%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Tanwen wang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​台儿庄偪阳故城","width":320,"height":240}}